      "text": "第四十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The temperature... is dropping sharply?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's ice forming on the ground..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's so cold..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unbelievable... even the burning effigy was frozen over....!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The flames were put out... Dark clouds have covered the sky..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aaahh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't panic!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Jessica, Blacksteel operator!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stay in position!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you doing, Frostleaf?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "She's... draining all the heat from her surroundings!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I never knew she was able to affect such a wide area!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Heh... Master of the Yetis..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I've never met... anyone with a lower body temperature than mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Meteorite... To be honest, I wanted to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Distract her... and buy some time for you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "But... my body... is completely frozen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I can't... move my feet anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf! !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Amiya, take them with you, and fight your way out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "In less than a minute, the enemy commander... will have frozen this entire square."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Don't make me die for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Amiya... We can't... I won't leave her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I won't leave Frostleaf behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I will not... leave anyone behind!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'll hold off the enemy squads' movements."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Meteorite... I'm counting on you to bring Frostleaf back!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Roger!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor! Please lead our squads!"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Way ahead of you!",
